						751830107
					],
					"speakerSubtitle": "Master Trainer, Collective of Plenty"
				},
				{
					"id": 751830107,
					"content": "A chill? Nay, nay. I merely shiver in excitement at your \"intensity\"! Come, come then, challenge my record. Try to claim the title of \"strongest in the Collective of Plenty\" for yourself!",
